(7497144, 1194922, 24983, '<td valign="top">Ha Ha looks like a mates house, he''s renovating, they dont need to flush the toilet as it absolutely bucket down in there.!! His G/f says new roof or no nooky so I guess he will fix in no time now!!!!!!    9</td>', 'Ha Ha looks like a mates house, he''s renovating, they dont need to flush the toilet as it absolutely bucket down in there.!! His G/f says new roof or no nooky so I guess he will fix in no time now!!!!!!    9', '2017-02-06 00:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497160, 1194934, 185714, '<td valign="top">Love the composition &amp; creativeness !!! Sweet colors.</td>', 'Love the composition & creativeness !!! Sweet colors.', '2017-02-06 01:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497245, 1194937, 114225, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition and view. Seems like there is a ton of JPEG artifacts here.</td>', 'Really nice composition and view. Seems like there is a ton of JPEG artifacts here.', '2017-02-06 10:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497246, 1194797, 114225, '<td valign="top">A bit heavy handed on the clarity and the shadows here, giving this a very unnatural look.</td>', 'A bit heavy handed on the clarity and the shadows here, giving this a very unnatural look.', '2017-02-06 10:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497247, 1194818, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great clarity in the lighting strike. Shows that this was in focus. But the buildings are blurry. Was your tripod a little wobbly?</td>', 'Great clarity in the lighting strike. Shows that this was in focus. But the buildings are blurry. Was your tripod a little wobbly?', '2017-02-06 10:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497248, 1194732, 114225, '<td valign="top">You have some pretty heavy chromatic aberration going on. Clean that up, and your image will shine more.</td>', 'You have some pretty heavy chromatic aberration going on. Clean that up, and your image will shine more.', '2017-02-06 10:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497249, 1194902, 114225, '<td valign="top">Looks like you might have really pushed the clarity slider hard. I would like to see what this looks like with a little less.</td>', 'Looks like you might have really pushed the clarity slider hard. I would like to see what this looks like with a little less.', '2017-02-06 11:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497250, 1194931, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice. It''s cool how the clouds even provide a nice layer to the top of the image.</td>', 'Very nice. It''s cool how the clouds even provide a nice layer to the top of the image.', '2017-02-06 11:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497251, 1194942, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Good colors (you didn''t overdo them). Good use of mist and depth.</td>', 'Nicely done. Good colors (you didn''t overdo them). Good use of mist and depth.', '2017-02-06 11:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497252, 1194457, 114225, '<td valign="top">Oh, that is cool. What a wonder to behold.<br/> <br/>But I think the editing here is really having a negative effect. I would love to see what this looks like with some changes:<br/>1. The sky is unnatural grey, like you pulled down the highlights a lot. It''s not bad to have blown out areas.<br/>2. The shadows look way to brought up. You have lost a lot of contrast.<br/>3. There is some really weird color fringing going on. Maybe just adjusting the chromatic aberration would solve that.</td>', 'Oh, that is cool. What a wonder to behold. But I think the editing here is really having a negative effect. I would love to see what this looks like with some changes:1. The sky is unnatural grey, like you pulled down the highlights a lot. It''s not bad to have blown out areas.2. The shadows look way to brought up. You have lost a lot of contrast.3. There is some really weird color fringing going on. Maybe just adjusting the chromatic aberration would solve that.', '2017-02-06 11:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
