(7499238, 1194883, 31829, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by booboo_goon:</b></div><hr/><i> Silky smooth! Let me know the settings for this ;-p </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you Luana.<br/> <br/>Settings:<br/> <br/>Nikon 35mm f1.8 DX lens<br/>F11<br/>6 stop ND filter<br/>3 exposure HDR (5, 10 &amp; 20 second exposures) with Lightroom to bring out the rocks, but keep the water from blowing out too bad.<br/>I used some selective color HSL and luminance sliders in lightroom to make the green moss pop a little more.<br/> <br/>Other than that, it''s just about what it looked like on a sunny day, in the shade. ;-)<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by booboo_goon: Silky smooth! Let me know the settings for this ;-p   Thank you Luana. Settings: Nikon 35mm f1.8 DX lensF116 stop ND filter3 exposure HDR (5, 10 & 20 second exposures) with Lightroom to bring out the rocks, but keep the water from blowing out too bad.I used some selective color HSL and luminance sliders in lightroom to make the green moss pop a little more. Other than that, it''s just about what it looked like on a sunny day, in the shade. ;-)', '2017-02-14 08:05:34.000000', NULL, 0),
